#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[bull-ogres,†1]]1. Bull Ogres"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:118
msgid ""
"If an Ogre unit can use its initiative to charge an enemy unit of humans at "
"the start of the Command phase then it must do so. This happens "
"automatically and their commander can do nothing about it. ‘Humans’ "
"encompasses all men including Chaos Warriors and Marauders, but not Dwarfs, "
"Elves etc."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[leadbelchers,†2]]2. Leadbelchers"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:122
msgid ""
"Leadbelchers’ cannons have a range of 15cm.  Leadbelchers’ shooting attacks "
"impose a −1 penalty to armour rolls."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:123
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[yhetees,†3]]3. Yhetees"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:126
msgid ""
"If a unit of Yhetees charges against an enemy in the open it receives an "
"additional +1 Attack modifier in the same way as chariots and monsters."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:131
msgid ""
"A Yhetee unit can only give support and be supported by other Yhetee units, "
"must pursue retreating enemies where possible and must advance into a combat "
"if they are able to do so."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:132
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[gnoblars,†4]]4. Gnoblars"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:134
msgid ""
"This unit is allowed to shoot as if it had bows but its range is reduced to "
"15cm."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:139
msgid ""
"A Gnoblar stand cannot be supported by other kinds of infantry – only by "
"other Gnoblar stands. Note, however, that Gnoblars can support other kinds "
"of infantry as normal."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:141
msgid "Gnoblars cannot be given magic items."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:144
msgid "Characters cannot join Gnoblar units."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:145
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[gorgers,†5]]5. Gorgers"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:150
msgid ""
"When trying to issue an order to a unit of Gorgers or to a brigade that "
"contains a unit of Gorgers, there is always a −1 Command penalty due their "
"beastly and unruly nature. Gorgers always ignore distance modifiers when "
"receiving orders and can pursue any type of retreating enemy."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:161
msgid ""
"Treat the order as issued to the nominated point, and apply the Gorgers’ "
"standard −1 command penalty and any modifiers for proximity of enemy.  Once "
"deployed, orders can be given to the unit by the same character that gave "
"the infiltration order."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:163
msgid "Gorgers don’t suffer the usual −1 Command penalty for Dense Terrain."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:164
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[rhinox-riders,†6]]6. Rhinox Riders"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:166
msgid "Units of Rhinox Riders are unaffected by terror."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:169
msgid ""
"Rhinox Riders receive +1 Attack when charging against an enemy in open in "
"the same way as chariots and monsters."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:170
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[slave-giant,†7]]7. Slave Giant"
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:173
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[scrap-launcher,†8]]8. Scrap Launcher"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:175
msgid ""
"Scrap Launcher is a xref:rules:artillery-and-machines.adoc#stone-"
"thrower[Stone Thrower] as described in the Warmaster Rulebook."
msgstr ""

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:176
#, no-wrap
msgid "[[bull-rhinox,†9]]9. Bull Rhinox"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:178
msgid "Tyrants, Bruisers and Butchers may ride the Bull Rhinox."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:181
msgid ""
"A unit that is joined with a character mounted on this huge beast causes "
"terror in enemies."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ==
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:186
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ogre Kingdoms spells"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:189
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tooth Cracker"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:192
msgid "[.cost]#3+ to cast# [.points]#Range 30cm#"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:197
msgid ""
"_The Butcher grinds his way through a lump of earth encrusted bedrock taken "
"from the peak of a mountain, imbuing himself and his fellows with "
"supernatural resilience. This often costs the Butcher more than a couple of "
"teeth._"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:200
msgid ""
"This spell can only be cast on an unengaged friendly unit within range "
"regardless of whether the Butcher can see it or not."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:205
msgid ""
"The target friendly unit can’t be driven back by enemy shooting attacks "
"until your next turn. In addition the unit cannot become confused for any "
"reason until the end of your next command phase."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:207
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bone Cruncher"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:215
msgid ""
"_Shovelling dry bones into his mouth, the Butcher painfully crunches his way "
"through femurs, ribs and skulls. As he points at his foes and spits his "
"bloody curse, the enemy find their own bones breaking within their bodies._"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:219
msgid ""
"This spell can be cast on an enemy unit. The Butcher must be able to see his "
"target to use this spell. The spell cannot be directed at a unit engaged in "
"combat."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:224
msgid ""
"Bone Cruncher is treated like three ordinary shooting attacks except that "
"armour has no effect (all targets count as having no armour). A unit can be "
"driven back by Bone Cruncher as with ordinary shooting."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:226
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bull Gorger"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:234
msgid ""
"_The Butcher greedily devours the heart of a Bull Rhinox, no doubt enjoying "
"the feast of healthy blood and muscle whilst he imbues himself and his "
"charges with the strength of a charging Rhinox._"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:238
msgid ""
"This spell can be cast if the Butcher has joined a unit in combat.  The "
"spell affects the unit he has joined. The effect lasts for the duration of "
"the following Combat phase."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:244
msgid ""
"Every stand in the unit, including characters that have joined the unit, "
"adds +1 to its Attacks value. As the Butcher must join the unit to cast the "
"spell this includes the Butcher himself, but it is possible for other "
"characters to join the unit as well, in which case the +1 is applied to "
"whichever character fights."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ===
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:246
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troll Guts"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:254
msgid ""
"_The Ogre Butcher forces down the toxic guts of a Stone Troll, great "
"quantities of acid and bile ravaging his much-abused gut as he transfers the "
"supernatural abilities of the troll onto himself and his companions._"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:257
msgid ""
"This spell can be cast on one friendly unit within range that is engaged in "
"combat."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/pages/ogre-kingdoms.adoc:262
msgid ""
"The affected unit increases its Hits value by +1 until the end of the "
"following Combat phase. At the end of the following Combat phase, the unit’s "
"Hits value returns to normal so any outstanding Hits will be applied, "
"potentially causing the loss of stands."
msgstr ""
